    "body": "More evidence for this issue, from the coordinator session of NeoTech:\n\n- Post-merge run 44713940674 on `81407b31b`: `wall 20.1 min, 977 step(s), 1 failed`. The failed step is `app suites: stock_source_holes`, with this test.\n- Post-merge run 44718580746 on `afbf1590e`: failure. The last green run was on `fd0b1e68d`.\n- The local batch gate of PR #2939 (a branch that contains `81407b31b`) shows the same failed test.\n\nIssue #2943 was a duplicate of this issue and is closed. A read-only second review (Opus) of draft PR #2940 starts now, because the change is under the safety floor.\n",
